              </Array>
            </mxGeometry>
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" mermaidId="e:D-&gt;A#0" mermaidBaseStyle="curved=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=block;endSize=7;strokeColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.67;entryY=0;" mermaidBaseValue="" id="m8">
          <mxCell edge="1" parent="1" source="m2" style="curved=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=block;endSize=7;strokeColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.67;entryY=0;" target="m6">
            <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
              <Array as="points">
                <mxPoint x="669.5" y="576.6" />
                <mxPoint x="323.85" y="615.35" />
              </Array>
            </mxGeometry>
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="s0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;INTENT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;Before deploying an agent against an opaque app, have it explore (or watch a human demonstrate) the app, generating a per-element documentation knowledge base; at deployment, retrieve element docs to ground actions.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="851.0" width="755" height="111" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;CONTEXT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;A team is deploying an agent against a mobile or desktop app whose user interface exposes no public API and no accessibility metadata that names its controls. The only way to learn what a given button does, or which menu reveals a particular setting, is to interact with the app and observe what happens. The same app will be driven many times by many users.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="815" y="851.0" width="755" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;PROBLEM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;Without any prior knowledge of what each element does, the agent has to guess on every screen of every task: it confuses the cancel button with the confirm button, misreads which icon opens search, and hallucinates the names of fields it has never seen. Every user task pays for the same rediscovery work, and a single misclick on a sensitive action (payment, deletion) cannot be undone by the agent reasoning harder next turn.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="976.0" width="755" height="149" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;FORCES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; Exploration costs time and money up front;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Demonstrations require a human, but a single demo amortises across many deployments.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; App UIs change; the documentation goes stale and needs refresh.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Documentation that is too verbose drowns the agent in irrelevant context at deployment.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="815" y="995.0" width="755" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;THEREFORE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;Therefore: split the agent&#39;s lifecycle into an exploration phase that authors per-element documentation and a deployment phase that retrieves only the relevant docs, so that opaque UIs become grounded at action time without flooding context.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="1139.0" width="755" height="111" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;SOLUTION&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;Split the agent&#39;s lifecycle into two phases. (1) Exploration — agent autonomously interacts with the app or watches a human demo, and writes per-element documentation: what the element is, what it does, when to use it. Store as a structured knowledge base. (2) Deployment — for each task, retrieve relevant element docs (e.g. via vector search), inject into context, then act. Refresh docs when the UI changes.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="815" y="1139.0" width="755" height="149" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;STRUCTURE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;monospace&quot;&gt;Phase 1: Agent (or Human) -&amp;gt; interact_with_app -&amp;gt; per-element docs -&amp;gt; KB. Phase 2: Task -&amp;gt; retrieve(KB) -&amp;gt; grounded actions on app.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="1264.0" width="755" height="111" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s7" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXAMPLE SCENARIO&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;A logistics company points its agent at an internal warehouse app it has never seen before. On every task the agent stumbles: it misreads which button submits, hallucinates field names, and clicks &#39;Cancel&#39; thinking it confirms. The team runs an exploration phase first: a human demonstrates a few flows while the agent records each element&#39;s role and the surrounding context, building a per-element knowledge base. At deployment, the agent retrieves the relevant element docs before each click and stops guessing.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="815" y="1302.0" width="755" height="168" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s8" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;CONSEQUENCES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Benefits&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Deployment-time actions are grounded in learned semantics, not guesses.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Single exploration amortises across many user tasks.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Human-demo mode lowers the bar to onboard a new app.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Liabilities&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Exploration is expensive and offline; production tasks must wait or use an older KB.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; KB drift when the app changes; staleness detection is non-trivial.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Element documentation quality bounds deployment-phase quality.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="1389.0" width="755" height="263" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s9" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;WHAT THIS PATTERN CONSTRAINS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;At deployment, the agent may not act on an element whose documentation is missing; missing-doc events trigger re-exploration rather than improvisation.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="815" y="1484.0" width="755" height="92" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s10" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;USE WHEN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; The agent must operate against an opaque app with no API documentation for its UI elements.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; The agent will be deployed against the same app many times, amortising up-front exploration cost.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Per-element semantics (what each control does and when to use it) are stable enough to document once.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="1666.0" width="755" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s11" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;DO NOT USE WHEN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; The app changes faster than exploration documentation can be refreshed.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Each task uses a different app, so exploration cost cannot be amortised.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Element-level semantics are obvious from labels alone and exploration adds no signal.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="815" y="1590.0" width="755" height="111" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s12" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;COMPONENTS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; Exploration Agent — interacts with the target app or watches a human demo and writes per-element documentation&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Element Knowledge Base — structured store of per-element descriptions keyed for retrieval&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Retrieval Index — typically a vector store that fetches relevant element docs at deployment time&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Deployment Agent — acts on user tasks while reading retrieved element docs&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Refresh Trigger — detects UI drift and reruns exploration when the app changes&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="1810.0" width="755" height="168" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s13" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;TOOLS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; UI driver (Playwright or mobile-UI agent) — executes the exploration interactions and demo replays&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Vector index — retrieves relevant element documentation per task at deployment time&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Diff detector — compares screen captures to flag elements whose documentation has gone stale&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="815" y="1715.0" width="755" height="111" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s14" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;FAILURE MODES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; Stale knowledge base — the app ships a new screen, the element docs still describe the old one, and the agent clicks with confidence on the wrong control.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Shallow exploration — the exploration phase never reaches rare screens, so tasks that need them hit missing docs and stall in re-exploration.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Bad element notes — exploration writes a vague or wrong description of a button, and every later task that retrieves it inherits the mistake.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Improvised click — the agent acts on an element with no documentation instead of triggering re-exploration, and a sensitive action fires by accident.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="1992.0" width="755" height="206" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s15" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;EVALUATION METRICS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; Element-doc coverage — fraction of interactive elements with non-trivial descriptions&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Doc-retrieval hit rate — share of deployment steps where the right element doc was fetched&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Task success lift over no-exploration baseline — headline value of the exploration phase&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Doc staleness rate — fraction of docs invalidated by the latest UI version&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Exploration cost amortisation point — task volume at which exploration compute pays back&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="815" y="1840.0" width="755" height="149" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s16" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;KNOWN USES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/TencentQQGYLab/AppAgent&quot;&gt;AppAgent (Tencent)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;available&lt;/i&gt; — Two-phase architecture; exploration writes element documentation consumed at deployment.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="2212.0" width="755" height="92" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s17" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;RELATED PATTERNS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;i&gt;specialises&lt;/i&gt; &lt;b&gt;Tool Discovery&lt;/b&gt; — Tool discovery for opaque GUIs.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;i&gt;complements&lt;/i&gt; &lt;b&gt;Skill Library&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;i&gt;uses&lt;/i&gt; &lt;b&gt;Naive RAG&lt;/b&gt; — Element docs are retrieved at deployment.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;i&gt;complements&lt;/i&gt; &lt;b&gt;Mobile UI Agent&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="815" y="2003.0" width="755" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s18" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;REFERENCES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.13771&quot;&gt;AppAgent: Multimodal Agents as Smartphone Users&lt;/a&gt; — Zhang et al., 2023&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="2318.0" width="755" height="92" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
