        <mxCell id="s12" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;RELATED PATTERNS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;i&gt;complements&lt;/i&gt; → [lineage-tracking](lineage-tracking.md)&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;i&gt;complements&lt;/i&gt; → [eval-harness](eval-harness.md)&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;i&gt;complements&lt;/i&gt; → [provenance-ledger](provenance-ledger.md)&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;i&gt;generalises&lt;/i&gt; → [awareness](awareness.md)&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;i&gt;alternative-to&lt;/i&gt; → [hidden-mode-switching](hidden-mode-switching.md)&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;i&gt;complements&lt;/i&gt; → [sovereign-inference-stack](sovereign-inference-stack.md)&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;i&gt;complements&lt;/i&gt; → [attention-manipulation-explainability](attention-manipulation-explainability.md)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
