        <UserObject label="success window clears" mermaidId="e:Draft-&gt;Assisted#0" mermaidBaseStyle="curved=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=classic;endSize=9;fillColor=none;strokeColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);html=1;fontSize=16;labelBackgroundColor=#E8E8E88D;fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);exitX=0.7452830188679245;exitY=1;entryX=0.678082191780822;entryY=0;curved=1;exitX=0.75;exitY=1;entryX=0.68;entryY=0;" mermaidBaseValue="success window clears" id="m5">
