        <UserObject label="" mermaidId="e:Tr-&gt;Sel#0" mermaidBaseStyle="curved=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=block;endSize=7;strokeColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" mermaidBaseValue="" id="m8">
          <mxCell edge="1" parent="1" source="m1" style="curved=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=block;endSize=7;strokeColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" target="m2">
            <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
              <Array as="points" />
            </mxGeometry>
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" mermaidId="e:Sel-&gt;Mod#0" mermaidBaseStyle="curved=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=block;endSize=7;strokeColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" mermaidBaseValue="" id="m9">
          <mxCell edge="1" parent="1" source="m2" style="curved=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=block;endSize=7;strokeColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" target="m3">
            <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
              <Array as="points" />
            </mxGeometry>
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" mermaidId="e:Mod-&gt;Rep#0" mermaidBaseStyle="curved=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=block;endSize=7;strokeColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" mermaidBaseValue="" id="m10">
          <mxCell edge="1" parent="1" source="m3" style="curved=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=block;endSize=7;strokeColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" target="m4">
            <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
              <Array as="points" />
            </mxGeometry>
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" mermaidId="e:Rep-&gt;Br#0" mermaidBaseStyle="curved=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=block;endSize=7;strokeColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" mermaidBaseValue="" id="m11">
          <mxCell edge="1" parent="1" source="m4" style="curved=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=block;endSize=7;strokeColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" target="m5">
            <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
              <Array as="points" />
            </mxGeometry>
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" mermaidId="e:Br-&gt;Cmp#0" mermaidBaseStyle="curved=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=block;endSize=7;strokeColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" mermaidBaseValue="" id="m12">
          <mxCell edge="1" parent="1" source="m5" style="curved=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=block;endSize=7;strokeColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" target="m6">
            <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
              <Array as="points" />
            </mxGeometry>
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="s0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;INTENT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;Re-run a past agent trace from any step with modified inputs/prompts/tools to debug or branch.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="1410.55" width="755" height="78" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;CONTEXT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;A team supports an agent in production where users occasionally hit weird, hard-to-reproduce behaviour: a strange reply, an unexpected tool call, a wrong answer on an input that worked yesterday. Engineers want to load the exact past run, jump to a specific step, swap in a different prompt or model, and see whether the alternative would have done better. The system already captures per-step inputs, outputs, prompts, model identifiers, and tool calls in a trace store.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="815" y="1410.55" width="755" height="149" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;PROBLEM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;Agent runs depend on non-deterministic model outputs, accumulated conversation state, and external tool results that may not be the same on the next call. Trying to reproduce a three-day-old bug locally usually fails because too much has changed, and engineers end up debugging by re-running the user&#39;s prompt and hoping the model behaves the same way. The team is forced to choose between spending hours on guess-and-check reproduction or shrugging off intermittent bugs that they cannot deterministically trigger.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="1502.55" width="755" height="168" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;FORCES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; Captured state must be complete enough to re-run.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Storage of full traces is expensive.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Modified replays diverge from original; comparison logic is non-trivial.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="815" y="1573.55" width="755" height="111" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;THEREFORE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;Therefore: capture per-step inputs, outputs, prompts, model ids, and tool calls in a trace, and expose a replay tool that resumes from any step with optional substitutions, so that past runs become debuggable artefacts rather than write-once logs.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="1684.55" width="755" height="111" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;SOLUTION&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;Capture per-step inputs, outputs, prompts, model id, tool calls. Provide a replay tool that loads a trace at step N and re-runs forward with optional modifications (different model, different prompt, different tool result). Store branches for comparison.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="815" y="1698.55" width="755" height="111" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;STRUCTURE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;monospace&quot;&gt;Original run --capture per step (inputs, outputs, prompts, model id, tool calls)--&amp;gt; Trace store --&amp;gt; Step selector (pick step N) --&amp;gt; Substitution layer (modify prompt / model / tool result) --&amp;gt; Replay forward (captured state before N, live calls after) --&amp;gt; Branch trace --&amp;gt; Compare branches&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="1809.55" width="755" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s7" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXAMPLE SCENARIO&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;A support agent gives a strange reply to a user three days ago and the team cannot reproduce it locally because too much state has changed. They open the trace store, jump to step 7, swap in the new system prompt, and re-run forward; the new prompt fixes the issue, the old one reproduces it exactly. They commit the fix with the trace ID in the changelog. Replay turns &#39;this happened once&#39; bugs into deterministic tests.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="815" y="1823.55" width="755" height="149" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s8" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;CONSEQUENCES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Benefits&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Debugging cycle drops from hours to minutes.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; A/B comparison of fixes becomes trivial.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Liabilities&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Trace storage overhead.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Non-deterministic external dependencies (network) limit fidelity.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="1953.55" width="755" height="225" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s9" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;WHAT THIS PATTERN CONSTRAINS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;Replay reads from captured state; live model and tool calls happen only for the modified branch from step N forward.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="815" y="1986.55" width="755" height="92" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s10" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;USE WHEN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; Agent runs are non-deterministic and incidents need reproducible debugging.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Engineers want to branch from a past step to test fixes or alternative prompts.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Per-step inputs, outputs, and tool calls can be captured durably.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="2192.55" width="755" height="111" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s11" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;DO NOT USE WHEN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; Trace storage cost outweighs the value of replay (low-stakes ephemeral runs).&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Privacy or retention rules forbid keeping per-step traces.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; The agent has no externally observable failures worth reproducing.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="815" y="2092.55" width="755" height="111" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s12" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;COMPONENTS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; Per-Step Trace Capture — records inputs, outputs, prompts, model id, and tool calls for each step of every run&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Trace Store — durable storage of full historical traces&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Step Selector — UI or API for picking step N of a past run as the branch point&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Substitution Layer — applies prompt, model, or tool-result overrides for the replay&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Branch Trace — separate stored run that holds the replay output for comparison&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="2317.55" width="755" height="168" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s13" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;TOOLS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; LangSmith replay — UI for branching past runs at any step&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Langfuse playground replay — trace-driven re-execution against modified prompts or models&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Inspect AI — agent eval framework with run replay&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Braintrust playground — branch-and-compare interface tied to trace storage&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="815" y="2217.55" width="755" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s14" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;FAILURE MODES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; Live call leak — the replay re-calls a real tool for a step before N instead of reading the captured result, and the branch diverges for reasons unrelated to the change.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Incomplete capture — the trace misses the exact prompt or model id for some steps, so the replay starts from a state the original run never had.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Network-dependent drift — the modified branch calls an external service whose answers have changed, and the comparison mixes the fix with outside drift.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Trace store bloat — full per-step capture is kept for every run, and storage cost leads to short retention that drops the traces needed for old bugs.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="2499.55" width="755" height="206" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s15" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;EVALUATION METRICS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; Trace-completeness rate — share of past runs that can actually be replayed end-to-end&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Replay fidelity gap — divergence between an unmodified replay and the original output (signals non-determinism leakage)&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Mean time to reproduce a reported bug — debug latency from report to deterministic repro&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Branch-vs-original lift — number of replays that demonstrably improve on the original after a fix&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Trace storage cost per run — bytes per run retained for replay&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="815" y="2361.55" width="755" height="168" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s16" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;KNOWN USES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;LangSmith replay&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;available&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;Langfuse playground replay&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;available&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;Inspect AI&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;available&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;Claude Code conversation rewind&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;available&lt;/i&gt; — Transcript-level rewind, not full trace replay.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;Braintrust playground&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;available&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="2719.55" width="755" height="149" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s17" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;RELATED PATTERNS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;i&gt;uses&lt;/i&gt; &lt;b&gt;Decision Log&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;i&gt;complements&lt;/i&gt; &lt;b&gt;Lineage Tracking&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;i&gt;complements&lt;/i&gt; &lt;b&gt;Durable Workflow Snapshot&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;i&gt;alternative-to&lt;/i&gt; &lt;b&gt;Journaled LLM Call&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;i&gt;complements&lt;/i&gt; &lt;b&gt;Determinism-Tiered Replay Gate&lt;/b&gt; — Replay/time-travel re-runs a captured trace for debugging; this pattern re-runs paired cases to classify a reproducibility tier and turns that tier into a release gate.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;i&gt;complements&lt;/i&gt; &lt;b&gt;Replay Divergence&lt;/b&gt; — Replay / time-travel re-runs a past trace to debug or branch; this is the failure where that re-run silently diverges from the trace it was meant to reproduce.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;i&gt;alternative-to&lt;/i&gt; &lt;b&gt;Forkable Agent Sandbox&lt;/b&gt; — That re-runs a recorded trace of model and tool calls with modifications for retrospective debugging; this forks the live environment forward for exploration, and restores process and session state a trace cannot reconstruct.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;i&gt;complements&lt;/i&gt; &lt;b&gt;As-Of Information-Set Pinning&lt;/b&gt; — Replay re-runs a stored trace from a chosen step but still resolves live tools against today&#39;s data; pinning is what makes those reads return the original information set.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;i&gt;complements&lt;/i&gt; &lt;b&gt;Harness-Native Rollout Capture&lt;/b&gt; — Replay consumes captured traces to debug or branch a run; this consumes them for a policy update, which is why the record has to carry token ids rather than rendered steps.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="815" y="2543.55" width="755" height="396" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s18" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;REFERENCES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.smith.langchain.com/observability/how_to_guides/replay&quot;&gt;LangSmith: Replay&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c5d0db;spacing=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="2882.55" width="755" height="78" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
